[94m# Code spans[m

A double-backtick span [91m``with a ` inside``[m and one that wraps [91m``across[m
[91mthe line break``[m before more prose.

A triple-backtick span [91m```wraps[m
[91mtoo```[m and a single one [91m`also[m
[91mwraps`[m.

An unterminated [91m``span stops at the blank line[m

so this paragraph is prose again.

